WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.660
Tesla added 43 cybercabs to its Texas commercial fleet, reaching 463 registered units. Two early prototypes were excluded from that official commercial count. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 645. NHTSA's lighting proposal, gigaburlin's weekly record, and the roadster at the Peterson follow, then first principles. Tesla Robotaxi LLC now holds the primary commercial registrations, TSL aiming reported.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.300
After those early units sat on a secondary test permit before the main entity page went live.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:39.460
The tracker follows the commercial fleet listed directly under Tesla Robotaxi LLC.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.440
Third-party trackers sometimes pull the older permit records and show 465 instead.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.560
Fleet growth continues under the commercial entity that handles the primary registrations.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:56.879
stations. The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration, or NHTSA, proposed optional

00:00:56.879 --> 00:01:02.719
cyan marker lamps for vehicles operating without a driver. Not a Tesla app places the change

00:01:02.719 --> 00:01:10.639
inside Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard 108, or FMVSS 108, as automated driving system

00:01:10.639 --> 00:01:16.339
or ADS lighting. The proposal also drops manual lighting controls for autonomous vehicles

00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:20.999
vehicles without steering wheels or pedals. Those changes target designs like the cyber

00:01:20.999 --> 00:01:26.419
cab that lacked traditional driver interfaces. Regulators are seeking comments on the optional

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:33.037
cyan lamps before finalizing the language. Giga Berlin built 7,000 model Y vehicles in

00:01:33.037 --> 00:01:39.197
one week, according to the Tesla Motors subreddit. The plant ran 24 hours a day across five days

00:01:39.197 --> 00:01:44.577
during that record week. The weekly total marks a new high for the German site. Extended

00:01:44.577 --> 00:01:48.437
shifted shifts let the line hold higher throughput without adding permanent headcount.

00:01:49.037 --> 00:01:53.437
Management is evaluating construction of a new assembly hall to support further output.

00:01:54.077 --> 00:01:58.337
Planning for additional floor space is underway to remove the current capacity ceiling.

00:01:59.326 --> 00:02:04.326
The roadster thrust prototype is on display at Los Angeles's Peterson Automotive Museum

00:02:04.326 --> 00:02:06.246
through October 27th.

00:02:06.606 --> 00:02:11.986
Visitors can only look, not touch, and the car sits in a roped-off area that blocks contact

00:02:11.986 --> 00:02:17.846
with interior and exterior surfaces. The prototype shows the updated design language ahead of any

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:24.204
production timeline. Tesla states the next Roadster will use an updated 4680 cell generation

00:02:24.204 --> 00:02:30.264
that addresses range and structural issues in the current Cybertruck pack. The new cells are expected

00:02:30.264 --> 00:02:36.864
to improve energy density and pack integration. Production timing remains tied to the broader 4680 ramp

00:02:36.864 --> 00:02:44.082
at Giga, Texas. Intel signed Tesla as a customer for its 14A Foundry node. The chip itself remains

00:02:44.082 --> 00:02:51.202
undisclosed, with AI6 and extra AI5 capacity among the likely uses. The agreement adds another

00:02:51.202 --> 00:02:57.002
external Foundry relationship alongside existing suppliers. Production would fall under Intel's

00:02:57.002 --> 00:03:03.137
advanced process node currently in development. A California cabin owner found that a powerwall system

00:03:03.137 --> 00:03:05.557
would not accept input from a backup generator.

00:03:06.097 --> 00:03:11.017
The cool down reported, the incompatibility surface while planning off-grid use at the

00:03:11.017 --> 00:03:11.317
cabin.

00:03:11.777 --> 00:03:16.597
The homeowner had intended to pair the batteries with a conventional generator for extended outages.

00:03:17.217 --> 00:03:21.437
The case shows a practical limit for remote or backup heavy residential setups.

00:03:22.411 --> 00:03:29.971
Tesla's phone app in version 4.62.3 adds interface fixes for iPad, dual iPhone setups and Android

00:03:29.971 --> 00:03:35.651
foldables, according to not a Tesla app. Release notes list those device compatibility changes.

00:03:36.211 --> 00:03:41.251
The update focuses on layout adjustments that improve usability on larger or folding screens.

00:03:41.991 --> 00:03:46.811
Owners with multiple devices or tablet setups should see smoother navigation after installing.

00:03:47.822 --> 00:03:54.802
Mazda's 6E arrives in Australia as a Chinese-built rear-wheel-drive liftback on the Deepal L-07 platform.

00:03:54.802 --> 00:04:01.522
Region Canberra reported, a single rear motor delivers 190 kilowatts and 290 Newton

00:04:01.522 --> 00:04:07.822
meters from a 78 kilowatt-hour lithium-iron phosphate or LFP pack. The vehicle is positioned

00:04:07.822 --> 00:04:13.242
as a direct alternative for buyers seeking an electric sedan without Tesla branding. Pricing

00:04:13.242 --> 00:04:18.442
details remain under discussion in the Australian market. The model draws on an existing joint

00:04:18.442 --> 00:04:24.138
venture architecture rather than Mazda's own earlier electric efforts. Full-self driving,

00:04:24.258 --> 00:04:29.198
or FSD, tried to turn the wrong way down a one-way street in Potstown, Pennsylvania.

00:04:29.858 --> 00:04:35.198
Tesla Roddy reported. The driver had to intervene, and that ended an ongoing supervised streak.

00:04:35.678 --> 00:04:40.935
The post included a short video clip of the moment of intervention. Independent researchers

00:04:40.935 --> 00:04:45.355
examined the roadster's cold gas thruster system shown in earlier demonstrations,

00:04:45.355 --> 00:04:47.375
conditions, according to Yahoo autos.

00:04:47.955 --> 00:04:52.655
Test results indicated partial success under controlled conditions, but raised questions

00:04:52.655 --> 00:04:54.435
about real-world repeatability.

00:04:54.935 --> 00:04:59.775
The analysis focused on the physics of the claimed jump capability, rather than marketing

00:04:59.775 --> 00:05:00.375
materials.

00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:06.537
Tesla has stated a goal of selling cybercabs to customers before the end of 2026.

00:05:07.137 --> 00:05:08.117
Autoblog reported.

00:05:08.817 --> 00:05:12.857
Regulatory approval for unsupervised operation remains the primary hurdle.

00:05:12.857 --> 00:05:17.937
Automotive gross margins kept tightening in Tesla's third quarter earnings, according

00:05:17.937 --> 00:05:19.097
to Yahoo Finance.

00:05:19.557 --> 00:05:24.057
Energy margins benefited from a tariff refund but could not fully offset the vehicle

00:05:24.057 --> 00:05:24.837
side decline.

00:05:25.417 --> 00:05:29.977
The report included updated capital expenditure guidance that trimmed earlier targets.

00:05:30.869 --> 00:05:35.689
A record week still collides with the same limit a new sports car hits when it leaves a museum

00:05:35.689 --> 00:05:37.209
floor, square meters.

00:05:37.209 --> 00:05:43.229
Each extra shift or robot cell still needs assembly, paint and battery installation space

00:05:43.229 --> 00:05:45.229
that cannot be compressed indefinitely.

00:05:45.869 --> 00:05:50.349
Adding more hours only delays the moment when physical space becomes the binding constraint.

00:05:51.069 --> 00:05:55.449
Utilization gains have a ceiling, and that is why another hall is even on the table.

00:05:56.049 --> 00:06:01.009
Volume production for a second vehicle family on the same cell chemistry has to share gigatexous

00:06:01.009 --> 00:06:04.009
lines that already serve cyber truck and structural packs.

00:06:04.009 --> 00:06:09.409
tax. That competition is for cell output and pack assembly time, not a free expansion

00:06:09.409 --> 00:06:14.649
of total capacity. Other manufacturers can buy lithium-iron phosphate cells outside

00:06:14.649 --> 00:06:20.569
Tesla's 4680 loop and avoid that internal queue for now. Staying inside Tesla's own

00:06:20.569 --> 00:06:24.689
cell production loop creates a different set of trade-offs on throughput and allocation.

00:06:25.449 --> 00:06:29.909
Vertical integration changes the cost curve only after the physical footprint is solved.

00:06:29.909 --> 00:06:36.649
until new halls or entirely new sites come online. A headline weekly record is a snapshot of utilization,

00:06:37.129 --> 00:06:40.729
not proof that the next doubling of output is already funded and permitted.

00:06:41.349 --> 00:06:47.209
Capital already committed to LFP Megapack lines and 4680 lines shows where the bets are placed,

00:06:47.649 --> 00:06:50.649
but the square meter bottleneck travels with every new program.

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:58.331
Tesla recorded $786 million in tariff refunds in the recent period, Shattered.io reported,

00:06:58.331 --> 00:07:02.491
and those funds are being directed back into domestic capacity projects.

00:07:02.811 --> 00:07:06.711
The filing treats the refunds as a one-time boost to energy segment margins.

00:07:07.271 --> 00:07:11.631
That check is incremental funding, and it does not create additional factory floor space

00:07:11.631 --> 00:07:12.271
on its own.

00:07:12.831 --> 00:07:15.231
The constraint is physical before it is financial.

00:07:16.366 --> 00:07:21.686
Looking back across the last seven days, Tesla's Austin CyberCab filing rose by more than

00:07:21.686 --> 00:07:27.726
260 last month, and Optimus production began in Fremont with a target of 20,000 units a

00:07:27.726 --> 00:07:34.246
week by 2027. Fort Bend County approved up to 35 years of tax breaks for Tesla's proposed

00:07:34.246 --> 00:07:40.426
$10 billion solar factory. The Boring Company's $3 billion funding now backs Tesla-powered

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:46.246
trucks hauling 20-foot containers underground. Bulgaria broke ground on its first Tesla-equipped

00:07:46.246 --> 00:07:52.766
battery storage park, with Acerel trade and power profit. Before we go, NHTSA is taking

00:07:52.766 --> 00:07:57.126
comments on those optional cyan lamps before the lighting standard is finalized.

00:07:57.586 --> 00:07:59.766
That covers it for today's Tesla developments.

